* Advanced Dynamic Testbench for LM358B
.include "LM358B_final_hermes_eval_r1.cir"
XDUT IN1_P IN1_N IN2_P IN2_N OUT1 OUT2 V_P V_N NC LM358B

* Power and Grounding
V_V_N V_N 0 0
V_V_P V_P 0 15

* Input Stimulus (Channel 1)
VINP IN1_P 0 SINE(2.5 0.1 1k 10u)
VINN IN1_N 0 DC 2.5

* Load Termination (Channel 1)
RL OUT1 0 100k

* Note: Crosstalk measurement requires driving IN2_P/IN2_N, but the prompt only specified stimulus for IN1.
* For completeness based on provided stimulus, we leave IN2 floating/DC unless specified.
VIN2P IN2_P 0 DC 0
VIN2N IN2_N 0 DC 0

* Simulation Control
.tran 10u 20m 10m

* Measurements (Adhering to strict format)
.four 1k 9 V(OUT1)
.meas tran v_rms RMS V(OUT1) from=15m to=20m
.meas tran icc AVG -I(V_V_P) from=10m to=20m

.end